    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>16</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#34;</mo></msup></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
